# Opaque set for the Aeneas lift of `crates/certify-core` (charon `--opaque`, name-matcher
# syntax). One pattern per line; blank lines and `#` comments ignored. Paired with
# certify-core.startfrom; consumed by scripts/extract.sh.
#
# The two-tier `lattice::Int`/`Rat` and the `Backend` trait are held OPAQUE so their bodies
# (which bottom out in the external dashu bignum) are not lifted; instead the opaque types are
# bound to their Mathlib ideals `ℤ`/`ℚ` and the ops to Mathlib ops in
# CertifyCore/{Types,Funs}External.lean (algebra-rehaul; docs/algebra-trust.md). This is what
# lets a `Rat`-using checker's lifted predicate reason over real ℚ instead of a bignum model.

lattice::rat
lattice::backend
